Done. Summary of changes:

**`src/lib.rs`** — Added `filter_by_tag`:
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes.iter().filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag)).collect()
}
```
Exact match via `==` (not substring), preserves relative order, returns borrowed `&'a Note`.

**`src/main.rs`** — `list` now parses an optional `--tag <TAG>` flag from the trailing args and routes output through `filter_by_tag`; without the flag it behaves exactly as before (lists all notes).

